{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1c8a0add41b56a0b6782d642a52266973d6648c9dfbf71c7d1194474e74753ad","ja":"おはよ～！\nふたりとも、準備はいい？","zh":"早上好～！\n你们两个，准备好了吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7e100c0cf3f07d276601fe097309d60c4d084f1866cd104ccc9b97e6ea0435bd","ja":"はいなのです♪　小鳥さんが起こしてくれたおかげで、\n姫はばっちり目が覚めているのですよ。","zh":"是的哦♪ 多亏小鸟叫醒了我，\n公主现在可是完全清醒的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"60e5e1e471e5757fe798c5e9a2a9e82cd065221eaa855631c130479d176d5779","ja":"さすがまつりちゃんだね。\n私はまだちょっと眠たいかも……。","zh":"真不愧是茉莉呢。\n我可能还有点困……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4cb914e2c70b532ef821de3895b6343a4bc2ad92234c3101434af746b1762929","ja":"で、でも時間だから、始めましょ～。","zh":"不、不过到时间了，开始吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"e2c9c46c3731bc785b29d1d0eb554fb562ed91840c117968ad6c16cb44357389","ja":"「みなさん、おはようございます！\nラジオ体操の時間です。まずは、背伸びの運動……」","zh":"“大家，早上好！\n广播体操的时间到了。首先是伸展运动……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"12c375a80764f4223b36622331ebba418d1751d80d681c34b88d6465c3bbbd8d","ja":"そして、ラジオ体操が終わって……","zh":"然后，广播体操结束后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"cb9e5a9a775e0a048e1c94382d4e91c4e3e31fed94119f3668a1f9aa18381b60","ja":"ふぅ～……最後までしっかり動いたら、\nなんだか体全体が、目覚めたみたい！","zh":"呼～……好好活动到最后之后，\n感觉整个人好像都彻底醒过来了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"8235aceb106f22f1df39fe938bfab0f8b528814c16a61e207cc3ab50250e21e9","ja":"雪歩お姉ちゃんもまつりも、思いっきりのび～って\nしてて、気持ちよさそうだったぞ！","zh":"雪步姐姐和茉莉都使劲伸展了\n身子，看上去好舒服的样子哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"31fccfcfc545ac8bf1326c7edb52bdbb2014469f96cf9db2bc74480459adc388","ja":"ふふっ。環ちゃんにつられて、\nなんだか姫も大きく動けたみたいなのです♪","zh":"呵呵。受到环的影响，\n总觉得公主动作的幅度也跟着变大了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5ff4a9c0c0bf2fc93ee22ab38c0974336830d26718db5338ff83de00e1afd7de","ja":"あっ、私も♪\n環ちゃん、すごくいいお手本だったよ！","zh":"啊，我也来♪\n环，你做出了很棒的示范哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"d181c02eeca246952c613136dd828347a733ff338a24cb3562ffaea49db812c5","ja":"やった～♪　たまきね、朝からふたりに会えて\nうれしかったから、張り切っちゃったんだ！","zh":"太好啦～♪环呀，因为一大早就能见到你们两个\n特别开心，所以干劲十足哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"139b08bb0ae83eeadbe17b71abdb08ea1129c1ba487521ac8556b51e539cbb0e","ja":"えへへ、私もすごく楽しかったよ！\nラジオ体操ってすごいね。すっかり元気になれたかも。","zh":"嘿嘿，我也觉得好开心呀！\n广播体操真厉害呢。感觉整个人都彻底恢复元气了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"c1a067133cdbd1bee703189a7e09867e5a9490f83d2522f11f5db649485ae9da","ja":"でしょ？　じゃあまた明日もみんなで集まろう！\nたまき、みんなとラジオ体操するの楽しいぞ！","zh":"对吧？那明天大家也再聚在一起吧！\n环觉得和大家一起做广播体操好开心呀！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"8af126c98a09e569ca69324153a403af93b09e880d8da1d9fce8afe7ab4894fc","ja":"姫も楽しかったのです♪　けど、明日は、\nみんな朝からお仕事だったのですよ。","zh":"公主也很开心呢♪ 不过，明天\n大家可是一大早就有工作要忙哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1108.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"543ec80023492fb93cbeae7ed0fb8e3e3039c66ff7522155374c48d78a1b21c5","ja":"あっ、そうだった！\n毎日みんなで体操できたらいいのにな～……。","zh":"啊，对了！\n要是每天都能和大家一起做体操就好了～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
